      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Missouri City grew around the Buffalo Bayou, Brazos and Colorado Railway, the first railroad to operate in Texas and the first standard‑gauge line west of the Mississippi.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29,
